Jenikins pipeline:
create server and login jenikins port no : 8080 
create a pipleine job
here we write pipleine scrpit 
pipeline {
    agent any

    stages {
        stage('code') {
            steps {
                //action
            }
        }
    }
}
Shortcut PASSS  --- pipleine--agent any--stages--stage-steps
pipleine have diff stages --- code---build---unittest--Artifact--deploy

Example :
    pipeline {
    agent any 
    stages {
        stage ("firststage") {
            steps {
                echo "THis is my own pipeline"
            }
        }
        stage ("secondstage") {
            steps {
                echo "this is my second stage"
            }
        }
        stage ("Thirdstage") {
            steps {
                echo "last stage"
            }
        }
    }
}
(u want pipeline stage view install the plugin "pipeline-stage view" ) 
